\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4b37cc9b-8e34-4be4-8b10-7b1ce390f752.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sPbxgQCiuC1788097913.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4b37cc9b-8e34-4be4-8b10-7b1ce390f752.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"2672e328-d062-4dd7-b790-536ec0ddc930.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026bP5sAz9ACa1788097930.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2672e328-d062-4dd7-b790-536ec0ddc930.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"459cf31f-a083-4280-9640-c0c56e240e49.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026yFUx9Ci3cP1788097903.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"459cf31f-a083-4280-9640-c0c56e240e49.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">香港小姐2026八強佳麗分別是1號袁絲珩Bernice、2號李澤欣Scarlett、5號魏欣Etherine、6號盧蔚晴Jasmine、7號楊媛媛Vera 、8號鄧匡閔Ada 、10號陳梓穎Cecilia、11號顏懿菲Agnes，3號李澄晴Chorie奪「友誼小姐」。</span><br/><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T16:48:30.709007+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":588,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}